---- MONITORS ----
------------------

hl.monitor({
    output   = "DP-2",
    mode     = "5120x1440@120",
    position = "0x0",
    scale    = 1,
})

-- The virtual output for remote streaming (Sunshine/Moonlight from the MacBook)
-- is not declared here. Hyprland names virtual outputs HEADLESS-<n> with a
-- counter that increments per process and offers no way to choose the name, so a
-- static rule would silently stop matching. ~/.local/bin/remote-display creates
-- it and applies geometry to whatever name it actually got. It is the single
-- source of truth for that output; see the autostart block below.


